      "html": "<p>Ferraris, C.J. Jr., 2007. Checklist of catfishes, recent and fossil (Osteichthyes: Siluriformes), and catalogue of siluriform primary types. Zootaxa 1418:1-628.</p><p>Ng, H.H; 2009. Tachysurus spilotus, a new species of catfish from central Vietnam (Teleostei: Bagridae) Zootaxa 2283: 16–28.</p><p>Zhao, H.H. 2011. Pelteobagrus (Tachysurus) argentivittatus. The IUCN Red List of Threatened Species 2011.</p>"
    }
